{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Provide funding for women & girls participation in all grassroots football clubs",
        "additional_details": "Too many clubs have decided to pull the women and girls sectors because they want to focus on the men\u2019s game. This is not okay with the development of female football again it feels as though females are being excluded.",
        "background": "I would like the government to provide enough funding for every grassroots football club to offer women and girls opportunities to train and play by 2030.",
